OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786556910
OL,3,CThe Office star Lucy Davis diagnosed
OL,4,Cwith 'incurable' breast cancer
OL,6,FLucy Davis, who starred in The Office,
OL,7,Fhas revealed she has been diagnosed
OL,8,Fwith "incurable" stage four breast
OL,9,Fcancer.
OL,11,FThe 53-year-old actor, who is the
OL,12,Fdaughter of comedian Jasper Carrott,
OL,13,Fis best known for playing Dawn Tinsley
OL,14,Fin the BBC sitcom.
OL,16,FIn a post shared on Tuesday, she said
OL,17,Fshe was diagnosed a year and a half
OL,18,Fago, and the cancer has "metastasised"
OL,19,Fto her bones, including her spine,
OL,20,Fright hip, and ribs, and it is "too
OL,21,Flate" for chemotherapy.
OL,26,@pD@FOUpD@PO]zD@YOUzD@fO]|D@`OU}D@EO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
