PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786556910
OL,3,CThe Office star Lucy Davis diagnosed
OL,4,Cwith 'incurable' breast cancer
OL,6,F"As of now, I'm trying to live out
OL,7,Fwhatever might be left of my life in
OL,8,Fas fun a way as I possibly can," she
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,F"I always like to find the teachable
OL,12,Fmoments in anything negative that
OL,13,Fhappens. And cancer has not
OL,14,Fdisappointed in that regard; there's a
OL,15,Flot I have learned from it, and I'm
OL,16,Fgrateful for that.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
