PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786556910
OL,3,CThe Office star Lucy Davis diagnosed
OL,4,Cwith 'incurable' breast cancer
OL,6,F"As some of you will know, the pain
OL,7,Fcan really be something else. Standing
OL,8,Fand walking for too long a time can be
OL,9,Fhard, and I need to use a wheelchair
OL,10,Fsometimes (so if you see me toddling
OL,11,Faround in one, feel free to give me a
OL,12,Fpush!)"
OL,14,FDavis said humour had been one of the
OL,15,Fmost important things helping her
OL,16,Fthrough cancer, asking friends and
OL,17,Ffamily to poke fun at her "as much as
OL,18,Fpossible" and, above all, not to treat
OL,19,Fher like a "sick person".
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@GO]yD@[OUzD@IO]{D@LOU{D@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786556910
OL,3,CThe Office star Lucy Davis diagnosed
OL,4,Cwith 'incurable' breast cancer
OL,6,F"There's nothing that will make you
OL,7,Ffeel more unwell than being treated as
OL,8,Fif you're unwell," she said.
OL,10,F"I'm not scared of whatever comes
OL,11,Fnext. I'm at peace with it.
OL,13,F"I'll see my Gracie sooner than
OL,14,Fexpected, and for me, leaving my
OL,15,Fphysical body just means going home.
OL,16,FAny and all grieving is for my family;
OL,17,Fit's far harder for them than for me."
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@RO]rD@AOUuD@AOUyD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
