OL,3,CThe Office star Lucy Davis diagnosed
OL,4,Cwith 'incurable' breast cancer
OL,6,FAccording to Cancer Research UK, stage
OL,7,Ffour breast cancer is a cancer that
OL,8,Fstarts in the breast tissue and has
OL,9,Fspread to another part of the body
OL,10,F(metastasised), making it incurable `
OL,11,Fhowever, treatment can control the
OL,12,Fcancer for some years.
OL,14,FDavis said she will continue working
OL,15,Ffor animal rights, adding that she
OL,16,Fwould also like to keep working as an
OL,17,Factress ` a job which is one of the
OL,18,F"biggest joys" of her life.
OL,26,@zD@AOUzD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
