CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786556910
OL,3,CThe Office star Lucy Davis diagnosed
OL,4,Cwith 'incurable' breast cancer
OL,6,F"For those of you on a similar journey
OL,7,Fto mine, I do wish you well. Cancer
OL,8,Fasks a lot from us, physically and
OL,9,Fmentally. And we all get to do it
OL,10,Fhowever we choose," she said.
OL,12,FThe actress shared a video of her
OL,13,Fringing a bell and reading out a rhyme
OL,14,Fcommon in many cancer treatment
OL,15,Fcentres to celebrate the end of
OL,16,Ftreatment.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
