OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786556910
OL,3,CThe Office star Lucy Davis diagnosed
OL,4,Cwith 'incurable' breast cancer
OL,6,FReading out the poem, she said: "Ring
OL,7,Fthis bell three times well. It's a
OL,8,Ftoll to clearly say my treatments are
OL,9,Fdone, the course is run, and I am on
OL,10,Fmy way."
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FDavis rose to fame playing
OL,18,Freceptionist Dawn in The Office.
