OL,3,CThe Office star Lucy Davis diagnosed
OL,4,Cwith 'incurable' breast cancer
OL,6,FThe show follows the lives of office
OL,7,Fworkers at Slough paper merchant
OL,8,FWernham Hogg, with co-creator Ricky
OL,9,FGervais at the helm as office manager
OL,10,FDavid Brent, alongside stars such as
OL,11,Fthe Hobbit actor Martin Freeman, who
OL,12,Fplayed bored salesman Tim Canterbury.
OL,14,FOne of the notable storylines
OL,15,Fthroughout the series is Tim and
OL,16,FDawn's slow-burn office romance.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
