OL,3,CThe Office star Lucy Davis diagnosed
OL,4,Cwith 'incurable' breast cancer
OL,6,FDebuting in 2001, the series ran until
OL,7,F2003 and also starred Mackenzie Crook
OL,8,Fas pedantic paper salesman Gareth
OL,9,FKeenan and featured appearances from
OL,10,Fstars including Sally Bretton, Ralph
OL,11,FIneson and Joel Beckett.
